#!/usr/bin/env python3

"""
Classify Windows PE binaries by target platform and runtime.

Separates Windows CE / Windows Mobile images from desktop Win32/Win64 ones,
and .NET Compact Framework assemblies from desktop .NET ones, then reports
whatever provenance the headers, imports, exports and resources still carry.

The three layers below are kept apart on purpose:
  - probe()      -- extraction only, no judgement
  - classify()   -- decision tree over the extracted facts
  - render_*()   -- presentation
"""

